# device, and so need a Vulkan adapter: `<package>/<test target>`, one per line.
#
# tools/ci_tests.sh reads this list (#227). CI's `test` job runs every test
# target NOT listed here, on a runner with no adapter, so a new test runs in CI
# by default; a new GPU test fails that job with `NoAdapter` until it is added
# here. CI's `lavapipe` job runs the targets listed here on Mesa's software
# Vulkan, except those with a reason after the name, which the reason explains.
